rustd-gotool includes a Go lexer, FileSet, parser, ast.Fprint
printer, and go/constant Int arithmetic whose control flow and error
conditions are derived from the Go standard library packages go/token,
go/scanner, go/parser, go/ast, go/constant, and math/big (BSD-3-Clause,
The Go Authors). Float64Val uses the same round-to-even quotient algorithm
as `math/big.Rat.Float64`.

Unicode identifier tables (Letter / Digit / Upper range tables) are
generated from Go 1.24.13 unicode data.

This is not a line-for-line translation of the Go sources.

